AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_37943> "A multi-component mixture comprising mostly of colistin A (R = Me) and B (R = H), with small amounts of colistin C and other polymyxins, produced by certain strains of <em>Bacillus polymyxa</em> var. <em>colistinus</em>. An antibiotic, it is used as its sulfate salt (for oral or topical use) or as the sodium salt of the <em>N</em>-methylsulfonic acid derivative (the injectable form) in the treatment of severe Gram-negative infections, partiularly those due to <em>Pseudomonas aeruginosa</em>.")
