# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_69136> (latrunculin A)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_69136> "A bicyclic macrolide natural product consisting of a 16-membered bicyclic lactone attached to the rare 2-thiazolidinone moiety. It is obtained from the Red Sea sponge <em>Latrunculia magnifica</em> and from the Fiji Islands sponge <em>Cacospongia mycofijiensis</em>. Latrunculin A inhibits actin polymerisation, microfilament organsation and microfilament-mediated processes.")
