# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_6923> (miconazole)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_6923> "A racemate composed of equimolar amounts of (<i>R</i>)- and (<i>S</i>)-miconazole. Used (as its nitrate salt) to treat skin infections such as athlete's foot, jock itch, ringworm and other fungal skin infections. It inhibits the synthesis of ergosterol, a critical component of fungal cell membranes.")
