# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81758> (cyproconazole)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81758> "A diastereoisomeric mixture composed of the enantiomeric pair (2<i>R</i>,3<i>S</i>)- and (2<i>S</i>,3<i>R</i>)-cyproconazole in ratio 1:1 with the enantiomeric pair (2<i>R</i>,3<i>R</i>)- and (2<i>S</i>,3<i>S</i>)-cyproconazole. A broad spectrum fungicide, it is used on cereals and other field crops used to control Septoria, rust, powdery mildew and other diseases.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_81758> "chebi_ontology")
