# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_8489> (propiconazole)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_8489> "The cyclic ketal obtained by formal condensation of 1-(2,4-dichlorophenyl)-2-(1<em>H</em>-1,2,4-triazol-1-yl)ethanone with pentane-1,2-diol. A triazole fungicide, it is used commercially as a diastereoisomeric mixture on soft fruit (including apricots, peaches, nectarines, plums and prunes), nuts (including peanuts, pecans and almonds), mushrooms, and grasses grown for seeds.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasAlternativeId> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_8489> "CHEBI:658576")
