AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_86411> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/chebi/3_STAR>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_86411> "cis-1-acetyl-4-(4-{[2-(2,4-dichlorophenyl)-2-(1H-imidazol-1-ylmethyl)-1,3-dioxolan-4-yl]methoxy}phenyl)piperazine")
