AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_87209> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/chebi/3_STAR>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_87209> "virginiamycin")
