AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_9986> "A racemate comprising equimolar amounts of (<i>R</i>)- and (<i>S</i>)-vinclozolin.  A fungicide used mainly on oilseed rape, vines, fruit and vegetables to control <em>Botrytis</em>, <em>Sclerotinia</em> and <em>Monilia</em> spp.")
